# Protocols Catalog — Mint-to Logic™
**Scope:** Canonical catalog of Mint-to Logic™ protocols + trigger systems with recorded, near‑verbatim roles.

## Contents
- `protocols.md` — all 28 protocols (definition, role, checkpoints).
- `/templates/protocol-spec-template.md` — spec format to split into per‑protocol files.
- `/evidence/prior-art-mapping.md` — source tags to this project’s threads.
- `/diagrams` — lifecycle and overlays (optional).

## Use
- Treat `protocols.md` as the master list.
- When stable, split each into `/protocols/<name>.md` using the template.
